{
  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"可通过本接口创建视频素材，需要提供客户ID、视频详细信息等参数。\",\"id\":\"\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/video/ad/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710600730639\",\"related_docs\":[],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710600730639\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"上传视频\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-ecaEA7H8\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bkGGzU4z\">通过此接口，用户可以上传和营销投放相关的素材视频</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-N44zS8sV\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">建议：对于连山url链接上传视频，请及时切换至</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1801533703648324\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #40a9ff;\"><u>异步上传接口</u></span></a></p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-edjGv3EY\"><br/></p><div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A1751576615688199%2C%22docLibId%22%3A1743864733602830%2C%22id%22%3A%22tzQDK%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"> </div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cSRFXkkB\" id=\"h346b9f0-dGUC1RrB\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-IGr4QVIn\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/ad/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/file/video/ad/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710600730639\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-cnU8DNS7\" id=\"h346b9f0-FtuOndnJ\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-TrMIfhtg\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Ol7lkcTc\" id=\"h346b9f0-H5PQ5vrL\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7WQS8p6S\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yaERepvv\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>multipart/form-data</code></p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-XhibAT8O\" id=\"h346b9f0-w4iJkaSN\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-HuZ9rQ53\">客户ID\n</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">upload_type</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-dKbWgwtF\">视频/音频上传方式，允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-jcAfUhaD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Kli9fFG8\"><code>UPLOAD_BY_FILE</code> 文件上传</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8e8RBSgT\"><code>UPLOAD_BY_URL</code> 网址上传</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-ToFB0cL2\"> 默认值: <code>UPLOAD_BY_FILE</code></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_signature</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1IkpaD4h\">视频的md5值(用于服务端校验)</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-YcSUbFH7\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0FbPePLo\">upload_type =<code>UPLOAD_BY_FILE</code>有效且必填\n</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_file</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>file</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hsKEwJhL\">视频文件，允许格式：mp4、mpeg、3gp、avi、m4v，文件大小≤500M</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-7AKDJlI3\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TT3JZVYX\">upload_type为<code>UPLOAD_BY_FILE</code>有效且必填</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filename</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-phqIphJp\">upload_type = <code>UPLOAD_BY_URL</code>有效且必填</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-RK2iQxwo\">素材的文件名，可自定义素材名，不传择默认取文件名，最长255个字符<br/>注：若同一素材已进行上传，重新上传不会改名。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">labels</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bU4jMzB0\">标签，多个标签以数组形式传入。</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-2gmwcaw8ds7400\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-x6htrgi8pj400\">请优先为无需付费信息的素材传入<code>仅IAA</code>标签，标记该素材仅IAA模式投放，不参与IAP模式投放；未传入该标签，素材默认为通用素材，可同时参与IAA和IAP投放。（该标签能力仅对短漫剧行业白名单客户生效，您可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1763407285579840\">【查询白名单能力】</a>接口传入<span style=\"color: #222222;\">gray_key = </span><code>R3_material</code><span style=\"color: #222222;\">查询您的账户是否具备该能力。未开通权限的账户</span>传入标签将返回错误）</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_url</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WouS4fXp\">视频 url地址，如<a href=\"http://xxx.xxx\" target=\"_blank\">http://xxx.xxx</a>，upload_type为<code>UPLOAD_BY_URL</code>必填</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-XQfO7DFZ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TffNfjkA\">仅支持开发者购置连山云素材服务上传生成的tos链接上传，不支持其他三方链接地址，具体见<a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/cloud/doc/1756427622851659\" target=\"_blank\">接入指南</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JKF4hbOm\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">建议：对于连山url链接上传视频，请及时切换至</span><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1801533703648324\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #40a9ff;\"><u>异步上传接口</u></span></a></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_aigc</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZvrSqPK9\">视频素材是否为AIGC生成</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">is_guide_video</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>bool</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-A1WXwLwD\">上传视频场景是否是引导视频（此功能仅游戏行业白名单客户可用，如需使用请联系运营）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">video_cover_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-50ismiy8q2k000\">视频封面ID。可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601820172?origin=left_nav\">【获取视频素材】</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710601254912\">【获取图片素材】</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710602404864?origin=left_nav\">【获取视频智能封面】</a>接口接口获取。</p><ul data-id=\"u1dr9j7ls-1hab7cglf0io00\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1t6vyw4f0b4w00\">（视频封面与视频绑定能力全新上线，素材库视频与创编主流程使用的同一视频素材将对应绑定同一个视频封面。）</li></ul></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JVaXTk58\" id=\"h346b9f0-AVOj8gak\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2F2%2Ffile%2Fvideo%2Fad%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH)%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20h